# Files in this directory that must NOT be published by `wrangler deploy`.
# Wrangler reads this file (gitignore syntax) from the [assets] directory and
# skips everything it matches, so the prototypes stay in git for reference
# without being served on the public URL.
#
# What ships is only what web/frontend/seoul-walk.html actually loads:
#   seoul-walk.html, config.js, app/*.jsx + app/api.js + app/swipe-data.js,
#   assets/, and the six data files fetched at runtime:
#     dong-jongno.geojson, nature-paths-jongno.geojson,
#     scores-named-streets-jongno.geojson, street-character-jongno.geojson,
#     street-character-locals-jongno.geojson, walk-net-jongno.json
# That is ~12 MB instead of ~51 MB, and no exploratory map is reachable online.
#
# Verified against every literal fetch() in app/*.jsx — none of the paths below
# is referenced by the app. Re-check this list if you add a new data layer.

# --- exploratory / debug maps, superseded by the app ------------------------
_verify-local-chain.html
local-chain-jongno.html
map-compare.html
map-with-paths-only.html
map-with-paths-only-osm-and-seoulcity.html
map-with-pois-test.html
maquette-itineraire.html
maquette-itineraire-ouvert.html
park-greenery-2btn.html
park-greenery-controls.html
park-greenery-slider.html
park-nature-paths.html
park-v2-compare.html
scores-5streets-jongno.html
scores-streets-jongno.html
street-character-jongno.html
street-character-locals-jongno.html
wander-mode-sketch.html
zone-jongno.html
seoul-walk - Copy.html

# --- dead app modules: loaded by no HTML page --------------------------------
app/map.jsx
app/map2.jsx

